Performance text displays calculated return percentages over a full year.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight investment-performance --accounts Assets:Fund --commodities FUND

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
P 2023-01-01 FUND 100 USD
P 2024-01-01 FUND 110 USD
2023-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -100 USD

